### Session 3 IPL: Book, BookCopy and BookAuthor routes.
### Seed data: ISBN 0064410935 is Charlotte's Web (author 1). Authors are 1 to 6.
### Book categories are C (Children), F (Fiction), NF (Non-Fiction).

### One book (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/0064410935

### An ISBN that matches nothing (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/0000000000

### Add a book and its author in one transaction (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "0000000001",
  "title": "Practice Makes Perfect",
  "yearPublish": "2026",
  "publisherId": 1,
  "bookCat": "NF",
  "authorId": 1
}

### Same request with an authorId that does not exist. The transaction rolls back,
### so the Book row is NOT left behind (500 in Session 3). Check Book in SSMS.
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "0000000002",
  "title": "Half Written",
  "yearPublish": "2026",
  "publisherId": 1,
  "bookCat": "NF",
  "authorId": 999
}

### Update a book (200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/0000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Practice Makes Perfect, Second Edition",
  "yearPublish": "2026",
  "publisherId": 2,
  "bookCat": "NF"
}

### The JOIN: every book one author wrote (200). Author 3 is John Grisham.
GET http://localhost:3000/authors/3/books

### An author with no books yet is an empty list, not a 404 (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/authors/2/books

### One copy, found by ISBN and CopyNo together (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/0064410935/copies/2

### A copy that does not exist (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/0064410935/copies/9

### Delete one copy (204). Try it on a copy of the book you added in this session.
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/0064410935/copies/9

### ---- Practice solutions (this branch only) ----

### Practice 1: the full list
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### Practice 3: every copy of a title
GET http://localhost:3000/books/0064410935/copies

### Practice 3: update the rental rate (200). 1.00 is refused (400).
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/0064410935/copies/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rentalRate": 9.00 }

### Practice 4: a book's authors
GET http://localhost:3000/books/0064410935/authors

### Practice 5: safe search. The quote in the title does not break it.
GET http://localhost:3000/books/search?title=Charlotte's
